{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>חכמת</b> [is] <b>הבין</b> — the verb's noun, meaning his wisdom is to understand the path fitting for him." "<b>ואולת כסילים</b> — it drags along deception, and they will always scheme to defraud others in their downfall."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {0 "Resolved the elliptical syntax by supplying bracketed verb 'is'; the comment parses חכמת as a construct infinitive (noun of the verb)."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:42.876605781Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}